"Language: zh_TW\n"
"X-Domain: hibira\n"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "你沒有權限執行這個動作。"

msgid "Connected. A test event was sent to the channel \"hibira-test\"; you can see it in the debug console of your app in the Hibira portal."
msgstr "已連線。測試事件已送到頻道「hibira-test」，可以在 Hibira 主控台中這個 app 的除錯畫面看到。"

msgid "Create a free app at %s (no card needed), then copy its app ID, key and secret here."
msgstr "在 %s 免費建立一個 app（不需要信用卡），再把它的 App ID、Key 和 Secret 貼到這裡。"

msgid "Connection"
msgstr "連線"

msgid "App ID"
msgstr "App ID"

msgid "Key"
msgstr "Key"

msgid "Secret"
msgstr "Secret"

msgid "Saved. Leave empty to keep it."
msgstr "已儲存。留空就會保留原值。"

msgid "Never sent to browsers. To keep it out of the database, define HIBIRA_APP_SECRET in wp-config.php instead."
msgstr "不會送到瀏覽器。若不想存在資料庫裡，可以改在 wp-config.php 定義 HIBIRA_APP_SECRET。"

msgid "Host"
msgstr "主機"

msgid "ws.hibira.io for the default cluster. Change it only for another cluster or a self-hosted server."
msgstr "預設叢集為 ws.hibira.io。只有使用其他叢集或自架伺服器時才需要修改。"

msgid "Port"
msgstr "連接埠"

msgid "TLS (https and wss)"
msgstr "TLS（https 和 wss）"

msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

msgid "Live comments"
msgstr "即時留言"

msgid "Approved comments appear for every reader of the post without a reload."
msgstr "核准的留言會直接出現在所有讀者的頁面上，不用重新整理。"

msgid "Post updated notice"
msgstr "文章更新提示"

msgid "Readers of a post see a notice with a reload button when you update it."
msgstr "你更新文章時，正在閱讀的讀者會看到提示和重新整理按鈕。"

msgid "Readers now"
msgstr "正在閱讀人數"

msgid "Shows how many people are reading a post. Each reader holds a presence channel connection; counts above 100 show as 100+. It shows in a corner of the page, or where you put the [hibira_readers] shortcode or the hibira_readers() template tag."
msgstr "顯示有多少人正在讀這篇文章。每位讀者會占用一個 presence 頻道連線，超過 100 人時顯示為 100+。會顯示在頁面角落，或你放 [hibira_readers] 短代碼、hibira_readers() 樣板函式的位置。"

msgid "WooCommerce order status"
msgstr "WooCommerce 訂單狀態"

msgid "The order received and view order pages update when the order status changes."
msgstr "訂單狀態改變時，「訂單已收到」和「查看訂單」頁面會即時更新。"

msgid "Admin notices"
msgstr "後台通知"

msgid "Shows a notice in wp-admin for new orders and for comments awaiting approval."
msgstr "有新訂單或待審核留言時，在 wp-admin 顯示通知。"

msgid "Check the connection"
msgstr "檢查連線"

msgid "Send a test event"
msgstr "送出測試事件"

msgid "Hibira is not configured."
msgstr "尚未設定 Hibira。"

msgid "This post was updated."
msgstr "這篇文章已更新。"

msgid "Reload"
msgstr "重新整理"

msgid "New comment"
msgstr "新留言"

msgid "%s reading now"
msgstr "%s 人正在閱讀"

msgid "100+ reading now"
msgstr "100+ 人正在閱讀"

msgid "Order status: %s"
msgstr "訂單狀態：%s"

msgid "New order %s"
msgstr "新訂單 %s"

msgid "New comment awaiting approval on \"%s\""
msgstr "「%s」有一則新留言等待審核"

msgid "View"
msgstr "查看"

msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "關閉"

